// Rule types (r):
//   monthly  {d, lag=1, ovr:{periodMonth:{d,lag}}}   due on day d of (period month + lag)
//   quarterly{d, lag=1, ovr:{q:{d,lag}}}             FY quarters Q1=Apr-Jun ... Q4=Jan-Mar
//   half     {d, lag=1, cal=false}                   FY halves (Apr-Sep, Oct-Mar) or calendar halves
//   yearly   {m, d, label}                            same date every year
//   dates    {list:[[mm-dd,label],...]}               several fixed dates a year
//   once     {date}                                   one-off deadline
//   licence                                          driven by the Licence & Certificate register
//   event                                            started by hand when the event happens (offset = days allowed)
// applies: "flag", "a&b" (all), "a|b" (any), "!flag" (not)

